@rafrsr That is a good point, you can also default the encryption to false, and enable it for specific cookies if your application only needs specific cookies encrypted:

``` php
$this->Cookie->config('encryption', false);
$this->Cookie->configKey('hello', 'encryption', true);
```

I'd would prefer to not disable the encryption by default, but only passing truthy values onto the decryption functions makes perfect sense.
